{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Poll for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"initiated"},{"type":"text","text":"’s outcome until it is decided or expires (§33.1, §33.7). Surfaces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing to the user — AXIAM notified them."}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC9cibaAwait_8tenantID13configuration5clockAA12OidcTokenSetVAA20CibaInitiateResponseV_SSSgAA0J13ConfigurationVSgAA0M5Clock_ptYaKF","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","symbolKind":"method","title":"cibaAwait(_:tenantID:configuration:clock:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cibaAwait","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"CibaInitiateResponse","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20CibaInitiateResponseV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"clock"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CibaClock","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9CibaClockP"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcTokenSet","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12OidcTokenSetV"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cib