dds 5 s to the interval, cumulatively and permanently;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"authorization_pending","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" never lowers it.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A transport failure, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"408"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"429"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"5xx"},{"type":"text","text":" (with or without an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"error"},{"type":"text","text":" member) that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outlived §16 is not terminal: the loop waits the interval or the answer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Retry-After"},{"type":"text","text":", whichever is longer, and polls again. A §16 wait or a loop wait that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would reach "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receivedAt + expiresIn"},{"type":"text","text":" is not taken: nothing more is sent and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expired_token"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised at once (§34.2 P10). A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"4xx"},{"type":"text","text":" without an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"error"},{"type":"text","text":" member is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decisive and ends the loop."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Anything that fails after a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2xx"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — a body that does not decode, an ID token that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not validate, the key fetch validation needs — ends the loop with that failure:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request is already redeemed, and polling again could only earn "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_grant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","t